    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ier26">
        <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e98">Caput 26</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_1@1-3">In principio regni,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier26-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-ier26-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e113">Haec <pb ed="#P" n="0041B"/> prophetia superiore prior est, quamvis sub eodem rege. Illa enim facta est in anno quarto, haec in ejusdem regis principio. Non igitur in prophetia historiae ordo texendus cum priora posterius, et posteriora prius dicantur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e120">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e122">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e124">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e126" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_2@5-7">In atrio domus.</quote>
            Ut etiam exteris civitatibus loquaris. Pulchre autem in atrio stat, et in vestibulo templi, ut qui ad orandum conveniunt sermones ejus audire cogantur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e131">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e133">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e135">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_3@1-3">Si forte audiant,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier26-Rd1e140"><name xml:id="gom-ier26-Nd1e141" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e144"><seg type="qs">Quasi dicat: Forsitan audient</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Forsitan verebuntur Filium meum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e153">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e155">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e157">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e159" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_4@8-10">Si non audieritis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e162"><seg type="qs">In nostra positum est voluntate</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nec semel et a saeculo, sed semper et sollicito?</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e172">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e174">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e176">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0041C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e180" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_6@1-5">Dabo domum istam sicut Silo.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e183"><seg type="qs">Sicut exstructo templo in area</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">factus pro nobis maledictum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e194">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_10">Portae domus.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Nova dicitur, quia qui in ea sedebant, et judicio praeerant, sacerdotum et pseudoprophetarum calumniae resistebant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e205">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e207">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e209">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e211" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_11@1-3">Et locuti sunt.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e214"><seg type="qs">Sedentibus urbis principibus in porta templi</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed futura bona cogitantes.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e223">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e225">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e227">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e229" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_12@1-2">Et ait.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e232"><seg type="qs">Jeremias illis accusantibus et crimen</seg>, etc., usque ad: <seg type="qs"><quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e237" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_15@22-29">In veritate enim misit me Dominus ad vos.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e242">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e244">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e246">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e248" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_13@1-3">Nunc ergo bonas.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e251"><seg type="qs">Quasi dicat: Si irascimini</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut nihil subtrahatur de veritate.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e260">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e262">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e264">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0041D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e268" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_16@1-2">Et dixerunt.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e271"><seg type="qs">Principes civitatis, et populus intellexerunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quas mutatione sententiae possumus liberare.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e281">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e283">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e285">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e287" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_20@1-2">Fuit quoque.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e290"><seg type="qs">Quaeritur cum Urias eadem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Christus quoque de manibus persequentium lapsus est.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e299">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e301">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e303">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e305" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_22@1-3">Et misit rex.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e308"><seg type="qs">Quaeritur quomodo Joachim rex</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et hanc prophetiam factam esse cum coepisset regnare.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier26-Dd1e317">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier26-Hd1e319">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier26-d1e321">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier26-Qd1e323" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier26_24@1-3">Igitur manus Ahicam.</quote>
            Quamvis Jeremias Domini auxilio liberatus sit, in mercedem tamen deputatur illi, per quem prophetam suum liberavit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
